WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.300
1886 — the first XI

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.800
1968 — level at ninety

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:13.100
1999 — the bench enters history

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:16.600
2008 — decided from the spot

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:21.300
1968 ↔ 2008 — some nights return

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:27.300
Both No. 7. Both scored.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:39.300
1998–99 — three must-wins

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:45.600
All three, from the bench.

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:53.300
Fergie time — the same late shape

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:58.000
671 goals after 85′

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:05.300
Only three needed rescuing

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:13.300
6,028 matches — pull a thread

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:16.000
Every claim leads back to its receipt
